<title>UK: World Bank sets 50 bln yen dual-currency bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 50 bln yen dual-currency bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Daiwa.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    50 BLN YEN    COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    21.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE   DUAL-CURRENCY ISS PRICE  98.5375   PAY DATE    21.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.1875    REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	COUPON IN YEN, REDEMPTION IN U.S. DOLLARS</p>
<p>		AT AN UNDISCLOSED FOREX RATE</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 500	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
